<!doctype lake><title>教案15-预处理与文件组织</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="fixed" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><h1 data-lake-id="wW3rt" id="wW3rt"><span data-lake-id="u41585001" id="u41585001">1.预处理</span></h1><p data-lake-id="d7f0fee269303cb899ed0cc39353ed26" id="d7f0fee269303cb899ed0cc39353ed26" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="u808f1653" id="u808f1653" class="lake-fontsize-12">在C语言程序源码中，凡是以井号（#）开头的语句被称为预处理语句，这些语句严格意义上并不属于C语言语法的范畴，它们在编译的阶段统一由所谓预处理器（cc1）来处理。所谓预处理，顾名思义，指的是真正的C程序编译之前预先进行的一些处理步骤。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u2d727e4e" id="u2d727e4e" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="ue4a4c64a" id="ue4a4c64a" class="lake-fontsize-12">合理使用预处理功能编写的程序便于阅读、修改、移植和调试，也有利于模块化程序设计。这些预处理指令包括：</span></p><ul list="uda5e17f0"><li fid="u167067af" data-lake-id="udee204af" id="udee204af"><span data-lake-id="u0203cb87" id="u0203cb87" class="lake-fontsize-12">头文件：#include     (指令导致一个指定文件的内容被包含到 程序中。)</span></li><li fid="u167067af" data-lake-id="u4e3211dc" id="u4e3211dc"><span data-lake-id="ufbf07c22" id="ufbf07c22" class="lake-fontsize-12">定义宏：#define   (指令定义一个宏，#undef 指令删除一个宏 定义。)</span></li><li fid="u167067af" data-lake-id="u93f52ecc" id="u93f52ecc"><span data-lake-id="u1b35eee7" id="u1b35eee7" class="lake-fontsize-12">取消宏：#undef</span></li><li fid="u167067af" data-lake-id="u4e3ef8ed" id="u4e3ef8ed"><span data-lake-id="ud0511d87" id="ud0511d87" class="lake-fontsize-12">条件编译：#if、#ifdef、#ifndef、#else、#elif、#endif  (可以根据预处理器可以测试的条件来确定是将一 段文本块包含到程序中还是将其排除在程序之外。)</span></li><li fid="u167067af" data-lake-id="ua51cfbfc" id="ua51cfbfc"><span data-lake-id="uc3cab5be" id="uc3cab5be" class="lake-fontsize-12">显示错误：#error  (较少用 到)</span></li><li fid="u167067af" data-lake-id="u17f8c783" id="u17f8c783"><span data-lake-id="u314a7fb2" id="u314a7fb2" class="lake-fontsize-12">修改当前文件名和行号：#line   (较少用 到)</span></li><li fid="u167067af" data-lake-id="u4dc184db" id="u4dc184db"><span data-lake-id="uba142ad9" id="uba142ad9" class="lake-fontsize-12">向编译器传送特定指令：#progma     (较少用 到)</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u0d806091" id="u0d806091"><span data-lake-id="uf8b00b7d" id="uf8b00b7d" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="u85dfaa03" id="u85dfaa03"><span data-lake-id="uf38b44f8" id="uf38b44f8" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">预处理是整个编译全过程的第一步：预处理 - 编译 - 汇编 - 链接</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91%E8%BF%87%E7%A8%8B%E5%88%86%E4%B8%BA%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8B%E5%9B%9B%E4%B8%AA%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%EF%BC%9A%5Cn%5Cn1)%E9%A2%84%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%EF%BC%9A%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E9%A2%84%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E8%AF%AD%E5%8F%A5%EF%BC%88%23%E5%BC%80%E5%A4%B4%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%AD%E5%8F%A5%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%A0%E9%99%A4%E6%B3%A8%E9%87%8A%E3%80%81%E5%A4%B4%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E5%B1%95%E5%BC%80%E3%80%81%E5%AE%8F%E6%9B%BF%E6%8D%A2...%5Cn%5Ct%5Ct%5Ctgcc%20%20hello.c%20%20-o%20%20hello.i%20%20-E%5Cn2)%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91%3A%E5%B0%86C%E8%AF%AD%E8%A8%80%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%BA%E6%B1%87%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%AD%E8%A8%80%5Cn%5Ct%5Ct%5Ctgcc%20%20hello.c%20%20-o%20%20hello.s%20%20-S%5Cn3)%E6%B1%87%E7%BC%96%EF%BC%9A%E5%B0%86%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%BA%E4%BA%8C%E8%BF%9B%E5%88%B6%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%5Cn%5Ct%5Ct%5Ctgcc%20%20hello.c%20%20-o%20%20hello.o%20%20%20-c%5Cn4)%E9%93%BE%E6%8E%A5%EF%BC%9A%E5%B0%86%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%8C%E8%BF%9B%E5%88%B6%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E5%90%88%E5%B9%B6%E8%B5%B7%E6%9D%A5%EF%BC%8C%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E5%BA%94%E7%94%A8%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E4%B8%93%E9%97%A8%E9%92%88%E5%AF%B9%E6%9F%90%E4%B8%AA%E5%B9%B3%E5%8F%B0%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%E5%BA%94%E7%94%A8%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E9%95%9C%E5%83%8F%5Cn%5Ct%5Ct%5Ctgcc%20%20hello.c%20%20-o%20%20hello%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22H6Qtv%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="8a2fa198e8691ea95dd110379b84d537" id="8a2fa198e8691ea95dd110379b84d537"><br></p><p data-lake-id="1ecab112512b1bd637e0d8b69d00104a" id="1ecab112512b1bd637e0d8b69d00104a" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560172845-5347ac4d-f9cf-464d-8452-693b0074b21b.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A152%2C%22height%22%3A221%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A283%2C%22originHeight%22%3A412%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23e5e5e5%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oo05k%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><h1 data-lake-id="fGvZG" id="fGvZG"><span data-lake-id="u51ab3f12" id="u51ab3f12">2.宏定义</span></h1><h2 data-lake-id="e5NR8" id="e5NR8"><span data-lake-id="u01917789" id="u01917789">2.1 无参宏</span></h2><p data-lake-id="47da09c926defd33275724f780481aad" id="47da09c926defd33275724f780481aad" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="ueb715a2d" id="ueb715a2d" class="lake-fontsize-12">宏（macro）实际上就是一段特定的字串，在源码中用以替换为指定的表达式。例如：</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23define%20PI%203.14%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Hlyt8%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="597ac880c167cdec062988d349e28a72" id="597ac880c167cdec062988d349e28a72"><span data-lake-id="uc508b023" id="uc508b023" class="lake-fontsize-12">此处，PI 就是宏（宏一般习惯用大写字母表达，以区分于变量和函数，但这并不是语法规定，只是一种习惯），是一段特定的字串，这个字串在源码中出现时，将被替换为3.14。例如：</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22int%20main()%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%E5%9C%86%E5%91%A8%E7%8E%87%3A%20%25f%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20PI)%3B%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E6%AD%A4%E8%AF%AD%E5%8F%A5%E5%B0%86%E8%A2%AB%E6%9B%BF%E6%8D%A2%E4%B8%BA%EF%BC%9Aprintf(%5C%22%E5%9C%86%E5%91%A8%E7%8E%87%3A%20%25f%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%203.14)%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mbToD%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="026e379d20cd15de7967ee2d4e322f4c" id="026e379d20cd15de7967ee2d4e322f4c"><span data-lake-id="ucaa237b8" id="ucaa237b8" class="lake-fontsize-12">宏的作用：</span></p><ul list="uff6d85a8"><li fid="u464fffb1" data-lake-id="u80c1bcb9" id="u80c1bcb9"><span data-lake-id="u648f44fb" id="u648f44fb" class="lake-fontsize-12">程序会更易读 。一个认真选择的名字可以帮助读者理解常量的 意义。否则，程序将包含大量的“魔法数”，很容易迷惑读者。</span></li><li fid="u464fffb1" data-lake-id="ubd84853d" id="ubd84853d"><span data-lake-id="uc2eb5cf2" id="uc2eb5cf2" class="lake-fontsize-12">程序会更易于修改 。我们仅需要改变一个宏定义，就可以改变 整个程序中出现的所有该常量的值。</span></li><li fid="u464fffb1" data-lake-id="uc877cf45" id="uc877cf45"><span data-lake-id="u22f08937" id="u22f08937" class="lake-fontsize-12">可以帮助避免前后不一致或键盘输入错误 。假如数值常量 3.14159 在程序中大量出现，它可能会被意外地写成3.1416 或3.14195</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="5a52a064147136814098aebc1e4f1142" id="5a52a064147136814098aebc1e4f1142"><span data-lake-id="ub9bf9453" id="ub9bf9453" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="6c46ef5e9080248cc77850138c67d3c7" id="6c46ef5e9080248cc77850138c67d3c7"><span data-lake-id="u3027292f" id="u3027292f" class="lake-fontsize-12">注意：</span></p><p data-lake-id="7a6c60db7f6936f466c763e3b01ced98" id="7a6c60db7f6936f466c763e3b01ced98" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="uc6bbe4eb" id="uc6bbe4eb" class="lake-fontsize-12">当宏作为常量使用时，C程序员习惯在名字中只使用大写字母。但是并 没有如何将用于其他目的的宏大写的统一做法。由于宏（特别是带参 数的宏）可能是程序中错误的来源，所以一些程序员更喜欢全部使用 大写字母来引起注意。有些人则倾向于小写，即按照Kernighan和 Ritchie编写的The C Programming Language 一书中的风格。</span></p><p data-lake-id="7812bb9f0bfc42b67c9c032dae9c0932" id="7812bb9f0bfc42b67c9c032dae9c0932"><span data-lake-id="ufcf1b0e7" id="ufcf1b0e7" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="8868a2fbf3f9599994f242cc2f262e13" id="8868a2fbf3f9599994f242cc2f262e13"><span data-lake-id="u7631de1d" id="u7631de1d" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><h2 data-lake-id="VglFR" id="VglFR"><span data-lake-id="u30b5004b" id="u30b5004b">2.2 带参宏</span></h2><p data-lake-id="027354f67f2bc709bfabb87ba92aef72" id="027354f67f2bc709bfabb87ba92aef72" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="ua0a8abfa" id="ua0a8abfa" class="lake-fontsize-12">带参宏意味着宏定义可以携带“参数”，从形式上看跟函数很像，例如：</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23define%20MAX(a%2C%20b)%20a%3Eb%20%3F%20a%20%3A%20b%5Cn%23define%20MIN(a%2C%20b)%20a%3Cb%20%3F%20a%20%3A%20b%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Hd1uo%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="uf661d6ab" id="uf661d6ab"><card type="inline" name="label" value="data:%7B%22label%22%3A%22%E6%B3%A8%E6%84%8F%22%2C%22colorIndex%22%3A2%2C%22id%22%3A%22ieVTd%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card><span data-lake-id="uab15daa1" id="uab15daa1" class="lake-fontsize-12">：</span></p><p data-lake-id="u1f595b40" id="u1f595b40"><span data-lake-id="ube1b27c2" id="ube1b27c2" class="lake-fontsize-12">定义宏没有分号；typedef （编译调用）有；</span></p><p data-lake-id="u1c304a7f" id="u1c304a7f"><span data-lake-id="u4a5f5803" id="u4a5f5803" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="6b9651d05316532fe6ba5c6b1418bef1" id="6b9651d05316532fe6ba5c6b1418bef1" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="u7c39a5d0" id="u7c39a5d0" class="lake-fontsize-12">以上的MAX(a,b) 和 MIN(a,b) 都是带参宏，不管是否带参，宏都遵循最初的规则，即宏是一段待替换的文本，例如在以下代码中，宏在</span><u><span data-lake-id="u564bfd06" id="u564bfd06" class="lake-fontsize-12">预处理阶段</span></u><span data-lake-id="u518c1d96" id="u518c1d96" class="lake-fontsize-12">都将被替换掉：</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22int%20main()%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20x%20%3D%20100%2C%20y%20%3D%20200%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%E6%9C%80%E5%A4%A7%E5%80%BC%3A%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20MAX(x%2C%20y))%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%E6%9C%80%E5%B0%8F%E5%80%BC%3A%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20MIN(x%2C%20y))%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8A%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E7%AD%89%E4%BB%B7%E4%BA%8E%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20printf(%5C%22%E6%9C%80%E5%A4%A7%E5%80%BC%3A%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20x%3Ey%20%3F%20x%20%3A%20y)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20printf(%5C%22%E6%9C%80%E5%B0%8F%E5%80%BC%3A%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20x%3Cy%20%3F%20x%20%3A%20y)%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TWB8U%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="c383f4e394b11d318abc723958dab274" id="c383f4e394b11d318abc723958dab274"><span data-lake-id="u91288bb0" id="u91288bb0" class="lake-fontsize-12">带参宏的特点：</span></p><ul list="u8e1bd7f0"><li fid="uc3301a6c" data-lake-id="uec06d11e" id="uec06d11e"><span data-lake-id="u882b3553" id="u882b3553" class="lake-fontsize-12">直接文本替换，不做任何语法判断，更不做任何中间运算。</span></li><li fid="uc3301a6c" data-lake-id="u16404fb3" id="u16404fb3"><span data-lake-id="u5ad66ab6" id="u5ad66ab6" class="lake-fontsize-12">宏在编译的预处理阶段就被替换掉，运行中不存在宏。</span></li><li fid="uc3301a6c" data-lake-id="ud5ddd4f9" id="ud5ddd4f9"><span data-lake-id="ue93761c5" id="ue93761c5" class="lake-fontsize-12">宏将在所有出现它的地方展开，这一方面浪费了内存空间，另一方面又节约了切换时间。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="a643379d67014380e26d3d63a4151452" id="a643379d67014380e26d3d63a4151452"><span data-lake-id="u78640ef5" id="u78640ef5" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="2ff61ff7d1f758520d3fe834e26874aa" id="2ff61ff7d1f758520d3fe834e26874aa"><span data-lake-id="u5f5d1e7e" id="u5f5d1e7e" class="lake-fontsize-12">带参宏的副作用：</span></p><p data-lake-id="3acde8e0cbfa2d84e764f17e58d0ffa9" id="3acde8e0cbfa2d84e764f17e58d0ffa9" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="uf5fbf93f" id="uf5fbf93f" class="lake-fontsize-12">由于宏仅仅做文本替换，中间不涉及任何语法检查、类型匹配、数值运算，因此用起来相对函数要麻烦很多。例如：</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23define%20MAX(a%2C%20b)%20a%3Eb%20%3F%20a%20%3A%20b%5Cn%5Cnint%20main()%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20x%20%3D%20100%2C%20y%20%3D%20200%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%E6%9C%80%E5%A4%A7%E5%80%BC%3A%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20MAX(x%2C%20y%3D%3D200%3F888%3A999))%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yH4Bx%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="f7de8aaef516eb6d9fa9e63e20f55397" id="f7de8aaef516eb6d9fa9e63e20f55397" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="ufaea0277" id="ufaea0277" class="lake-fontsize-12">直观上看，无论 y 的取值是多少，表达式 y==200?888:999 的值一定比 x 要大，但由于宏定义仅仅是文本替换，中间不涉及任何运算，因此等价于：</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22printf(%5C%22%E6%9C%80%E5%A4%A7%E5%80%BC%3A%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20x%3Ey%3D%3D200%3F888%3A999%20%3F%20x%20%3A%20y%3D%3D200%3F888%3A999)%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HetZB%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="9526e7f1aa0ac37c80d3c2074236d593" id="9526e7f1aa0ac37c80d3c2074236d593"><span data-lake-id="u088305cc" id="u088305cc" class="lake-fontsize-12">可见，带参宏的参数不能像函数参数那样视为一个整体，整个宏定义也不能视为一个单一的数据，事实上，不管是宏参数还是宏本身，都应被视为一个字串，或者一个表达式，或者一段文本，因此最基本的原则是：</span></p><p data-lake-id="d0306a66737e569a3b816069e96e0f8f" id="d0306a66737e569a3b816069e96e0f8f"><span data-lake-id="u094e4ead" id="u094e4ead" class="lake-fontsize-12">将宏定义中所有能用括号括起来的部分，都括起来，比如：</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23define%20MAX(a%2C%20b)%20((a)%3E(b)%20%3F%20(a)%20%3A%20(b))%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vj3M5%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><h1 data-lake-id="kYEAo" id="kYEAo"><span data-lake-id="ue415fb79" id="ue415fb79">3.条件编译</span></h1><p data-lake-id="79ee474cca5dd9b75fd4e8fc129cdb64" id="79ee474cca5dd9b75fd4e8fc129cdb64" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="u6c53bd9f" id="u6c53bd9f" class="lake-fontsize-12">概念：有条件的编译，通过控制某些宏的值，来决定编译哪段代码。</span></p><p data-lake-id="23f6e95cb179e4f32e862d9d5789feff" id="23f6e95cb179e4f32e862d9d5789feff" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560173075-e2cbdfa9-484f-4a68-b77a-e108b98ff8cd.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A466%2C%22height%22%3A282%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A697%2C%22originHeight%22%3A422%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f2f1f0%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cau4P%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="45bfa3d5b1f5ecf969cf5f0266063145" id="45bfa3d5b1f5ecf969cf5f0266063145"><span data-lake-id="u62843785" id="u62843785" class="lake-fontsize-12">形式：</span></p><ul list="u6889ead7"><li fid="u386758ba" data-lake-id="u23391071" id="u23391071"><span data-lake-id="ud6062ece" id="ud6062ece" class="lake-fontsize-12">形式1：判断表达式 MACRO 是否为真，据此决定其所包含的代码段是否要编译</span></li></ul><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23if%20MACRO%5Cn%20%20%20%20...%20%2F%2F%20%E5%A6%82%E6%9E%9C%20MACRO%20%E4%B8%BA%E7%9C%9F%EF%BC%8C%E9%82%A3%E4%B9%88%E8%AF%A5%E6%AE%B5%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E5%B0%86%E8%A2%AB%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%A6%E5%88%99%E8%A2%AB%E4%B8%A2%E5%BC%83%5Cn%23endif%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JUEUl%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%5Cn%23define%20A%200%5Cn%23define%20B%201%5Cn%5Cnint%20main()%5Cn%7B%5Cn%23if%20A%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%221%5C%5Cn%5C%22)%3B%5Cn%23endif%5Cn%5Cn%23if%20B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%222%5C%5Cn%5C%22)%3B%5Cn%23endif%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JmSVv%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><ul list="u14a919a4"><li fid="u791709f3" data-lake-id="u0c01f7db" id="u0c01f7db"><span data-lake-id="u8725de92" id="u8725de92" class="lake-fontsize-12">形式2：判断宏 MACRO 是否已被定义，据此决定其所包含的代码段是否要编译</span></li></ul><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%2F%2F%20%E5%8D%95%E7%8B%AC%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%5Cn%23ifdef%20MACRO%5Cn%20%20%20%20...%5Cn%23endif%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%20%E4%BA%8C%E8%B7%AF%E5%88%86%E6%94%AF%5Cn%23ifdef%20MACRO%5Cn%20%20%20%20...%5Cn%23else%5Cn%20%20%20...%5Cn%23endif%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%20%E5%A4%9A%E8%B7%AF%E5%88%86%E6%94%AF%5Cn%23ifdef%20MACRO1%5Cn%20%20%20%20...%5Cn%23elif%20MACRO2%5Cn%20%20%20%20...%5Cn%23elif%20MACRO3%5Cn%20%20%20%20...%5Cn%23endif%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YBXsM%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><ul list="u9a3c8401"><li fid="uc0d36e12" data-lake-id="ubd3ca1bc" id="ubd3ca1bc"><span data-lake-id="ub1dc7409" id="ub1dc7409" class="lake-fontsize-12">形式3：判断宏MACRO是否未被定义，据此决定其所包含的代码段是否要编译</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="2a0ac95a7fa77d4f918987068d917801" id="2a0ac95a7fa77d4f918987068d917801"><span data-lake-id="u11af86bd" id="u11af86bd" class="lake-fontsize-12">// 单独判断</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23ifndef%20MACRO%5Cn%20%20%20%20...%5Cn%23endif%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%20%E4%BA%8C%E8%B7%AF%E5%88%86%E6%94%AF%5Cn%23ifndef%20MACRO%5Cn%20%20%20%20...%5Cn%23else%5Cn%20%20%20...%5Cn%23endif%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22knB9q%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="ad4fd0fe414a7b9cc594f8cda5a6db85" id="ad4fd0fe414a7b9cc594f8cda5a6db85"><span data-lake-id="u0245fb04" id="u0245fb04" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%5Cn%23ifndef%20PI%5Cn%23define%20PI%203.1416%5Cn%23endif%5Cn%5Cnint%20main()%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25f%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2CPI)%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RgKw7%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="d4c37698f0695f705cea67aefc441741" id="d4c37698f0695f705cea67aefc441741"><span data-lake-id="ue83e4ee6" id="ue83e4ee6" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="e0002131287827b8d36b2ab1185cc108" id="e0002131287827b8d36b2ab1185cc108"><span data-lake-id="u15fcff7f" id="u15fcff7f" class="lake-fontsize-12">条件编译的使用场景</span></p><ul list="u81691ae4"><li fid="u94e1c772" data-lake-id="uf92b8ef2" id="uf92b8ef2"><span data-lake-id="u9c72188c" id="u9c72188c" class="lake-fontsize-12">控制调试语句：在程序中，用条件编译将调试语句包裹起来，通过gcc编译选项随意控制调试代码的启停状态。例如：</span></li></ul><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22gcc%20example.c%20-o%20example%20-DMACRO%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LOFuU%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%5Cn%23define%20A%200%5Cn%2F%2F%20%23define%20B%201%5Cn%5Cnint%20main()%5Cn%7B%5Cn%5Cn%5Cn%23ifdef%20MACRO1%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E6%AE%B5MACRO1%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%5C%5Cn%5C%22)%3B%5Cn%5Cn%23endif%5Cn%5Cn%23ifdef%20MACRO2%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E6%AE%B5MACRO2%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%5C%5Cn%5C%22)%3B%5Cn%5Cn%23endif%5Cn%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22If2jM%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="d79cad4ffeac2d45d20539add6893b12" id="d79cad4ffeac2d45d20539add6893b12" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="u8d089995" id="u8d089995" class="lake-fontsize-12">以上语句中，-D意味着 Define，MACRO 是程序中用来控制调试语句的一个宏，如此一来就可以在完全不需要修改源代码的情况下，通过外部编译指令选项非常方便地控制调试信息的启停。</span></p><ul list="u5707ff89"><li fid="ucc3fbabe" data-lake-id="u3f284b61" id="u3f284b61"><span data-lake-id="u633374a6" id="u633374a6" class="lake-fontsize-12">选择代码片段：在一些大型项目中（例如 Linux 内核），某个相同功能的模块往往有不同的实现，需要用户根据具体的情况来“配置”，这个所谓的配置的过程，就是对代码中不同的宏的选择的过程。例如：</span></li></ul><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23ifdef%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20...%5Cn%23elif%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20...%5Cn%23elif%20%20XXX3%5Cn%20%20%20%20...%5Cn%20%20%20%20...%5Cn%23endif%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BlGDb%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><h1 data-lake-id="VNlJR" id="VNlJR"><span data-lake-id="ud1875e73" id="ud1875e73">4.头文件</span></h1><p data-lake-id="eda2ae709dc040dab5d4f894df246553" id="eda2ae709dc040dab5d4f894df246553" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="uce5d90d0" id="uce5d90d0" class="lake-fontsize-12">虽然某些C程序小得足够放入一个单独的文件中，但是大多数程序都不 是这样的。程序由多个文件构成的原则更容易让人接受。到现在为止一直假设C程序是由单独一个文件组成的。事实上，可以把 程序分割成任意数量的源文件 。根据惯例，源文件的扩展名为.c 。 每个源文件包含程序的部分内容，主要是函数和变量的定义。其中一 个源文件必须包含一个名为main 的函数，此函数作为程序的起始 点。</span></p><p data-lake-id="653652cd08e1b3eb4bdc43fa907f1450" id="653652cd08e1b3eb4bdc43fa907f1450" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="ub39a9109" id="ub39a9109" class="lake-fontsize-12">当把程序分割为几个源文件时，问题也随之产生了：某文件中的函数 如何调用定义在其他文件中的函数呢？函数如何访问其他文件中的外 部变量呢？两个文件如何共享同一个宏定义或类型定义呢？答案取决 于#include 指令，此指令使得在任意数量的源文件中共享信息成为 可能</span></p><p data-lake-id="71b5b8717f25c510557f4c8a93406477" id="71b5b8717f25c510557f4c8a93406477" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="u8fe888b6" id="u8fe888b6" class="lake-fontsize-12">通常，一个常规的C语言程序会包含多个源码文件（*.c），每个（*.c）文件都有一个对应的(*.h)文件</span></p><p data-lake-id="938e240bc50af37ed9558448e8b70cb0" id="938e240bc50af37ed9558448e8b70cb0"><span data-lake-id="udae9b8a3" id="udae9b8a3" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="7b238afc2734d702d0bbd1bf4cd179bd" id="7b238afc2734d702d0bbd1bf4cd179bd" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560173334-9e223b05-d0b3-451e-88d6-61b1a43003db.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A363%2C%22height%22%3A300%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A550%2C%22originHeight%22%3A454%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f8f9eb%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22S4uI9%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="96bc5130f29ad4209d4ac6bf6e590661" id="96bc5130f29ad4209d4ac6bf6e590661"><span data-lake-id="u1f211076" id="u1f211076" class="lake-fontsize-12">头文件的内容</span></p><p data-lake-id="cf20f86fdd97ee5dcb378e65a5dc9e7e" id="cf20f86fdd97ee5dcb378e65a5dc9e7e"><span data-lake-id="ud7598294" id="ud7598294" class="lake-fontsize-12">头文件中所存放的内容，就是各个源码文件的彼此可见的公共资源，包括：</span></p><ul list="u703ea1cb"><li fid="u72aefbf2" data-lake-id="ua6bdf6b9" id="ua6bdf6b9"><span data-lake-id="u735e6b67" id="u735e6b67" class="lake-fontsize-12">全局变量的声明（不一定）</span></li><li fid="u72aefbf2" data-lake-id="u5679e1fe" id="u5679e1fe"><span data-lake-id="ua8f8d332" id="ua8f8d332" class="lake-fontsize-12">普通函数的声明。</span></li><li fid="u72aefbf2" data-lake-id="ud9bc6b25" id="ud9bc6b25"><span data-lake-id="ue6630d0e" id="ue6630d0e" class="lake-fontsize-12">宏定义。</span></li><li fid="u72aefbf2" data-lake-id="u55d959be" id="u55d959be"><span data-lake-id="u9e31ee89" id="u9e31ee89" class="lake-fontsize-12">结构体、联合体的定义。</span></li><li fid="u72aefbf2" data-lake-id="u1c349a9a" id="u1c349a9a"><span data-lake-id="u0e31a8ac" id="u0e31a8ac" class="lake-fontsize-12">枚举常量列表的定义。</span></li><li fid="u72aefbf2" data-lake-id="u12a3baa8" id="u12a3baa8"><span data-lake-id="ue311fed4" id="ue311fed4" class="lake-fontsize-12">其他头文件。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="f38caf9b023658f69e3cce572b4a7d26" id="f38caf9b023658f69e3cce572b4a7d26"><span data-lake-id="u9a6a936a" id="u9a6a936a" class="lake-fontsize-12">特别说明：</span></p><ul list="ucf95e50c"><li fid="u01f9934d" data-lake-id="ucecd5a74" id="ucecd5a74"><span data-lake-id="u17f3d7ad" id="u17f3d7ad" class="lake-fontsize-12">全局变量、普通函数的定义一般出现在某个源码文件中，其他的源码文件想要使用都需要进行声明，因此一般放在头文件中更方便。</span></li><li fid="u01f9934d" data-lake-id="u291a2be2" id="u291a2be2"><span data-lake-id="u7bde50c6" id="u7bde50c6" class="lake-fontsize-12">静态函数、宏定义、结构体、联合体的定义都只能在其所在的文件可见，因此如果多个源码文件都需要使用的话，放到头文件中定义是最方便，也是最安全的选择。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="9ca0e23258d3a11e2b72ed8c0e10a759" id="9ca0e23258d3a11e2b72ed8c0e10a759"><span data-lake-id="u941a13cc" id="u941a13cc" class="lake-fontsize-12">头文件的使用</span></p><ul list="u9937a85f"><li fid="u44ed4465" data-lake-id="u3a9ae29e" id="u3a9ae29e"><span data-lake-id="ue1378481" id="ue1378481" class="lake-fontsize-12"> 头文件编写好了之后，就可以被各个所需要的源码文件包含了，包含头文件的语句就是如下预处理指令：</span></li></ul><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%2F%2F%20main.c%5Cn%23include%20%5C%22head.h%5C%22%20%20%2F%2F%20%E5%8C%85%E5%90%AB%E8%87%AA%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%B4%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%5Cn%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%20%2F%2F%20%E5%8C%85%E5%90%AB%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E9%A2%84%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E7%9A%84%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%5Cn%5Cnint%20main()%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20...%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pz7jP%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="832378a4f8892720bdebf5808b508a72" id="832378a4f8892720bdebf5808b508a72"><span data-lake-id="u14c2f351" id="u14c2f351" class="lake-fontsize-12">可以看到，在源码文件中包含指定的头文件有两种不同的形式：</span></p><ul list="udd0b6c94"><li fid="u64d87685" data-lake-id="ufbaefe48" id="ufbaefe48"><span data-lake-id="u894ef323" id="u894ef323" class="lake-fontsize-12">使用双引号：在指定位置 + 系统标准路径搜索 head.h</span></li><li fid="u64d87685" data-lake-id="u69d47fc0" id="u69d47fc0"><span data-lake-id="u26c5ba6b" id="u26c5ba6b" class="lake-fontsize-12">使用尖括号：在系统标准路径搜索 stdio.h</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue333a692" id="ue333a692"><br></p><p data-lake-id="542245e4aff6621d62243ef0083dd0a7" id="542245e4aff6621d62243ef0083dd0a7" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="u306458fc" id="u306458fc" class="lake-fontsize-12">如果源文件包含同一个头文件两次，那么可能产生编译错误。当头文 件包含其他头文件时，这种问题十分普遍。</span></p><p data-lake-id="ua259519e" id="ua259519e" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="udb9a63dd" id="udb9a63dd" class="lake-fontsize-12">例如，假设file1.h 包 含file3.h ，file2.h 包含file3.h ，而prog.c 同时包含 file1.h 和file2.h （如下图所示），那么在编译prog.c 时， file3.h 就会被编译两次。</span></p><p data-lake-id="d3c9bb185ee9116563ac2bd3dd0d7076" id="d3c9bb185ee9116563ac2bd3dd0d7076" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560173798-d7262d70-6166-42c3-a996-9666c27be2e1.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A477%2C%22height%22%3A266%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1099%2C%22originHeight%22%3A612%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f8f8f8%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kZ1uO%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="eda5699e43f9dd292a2f785d014927b1" id="eda5699e43f9dd292a2f785d014927b1"><span data-lake-id="ud5e58527" id="ud5e58527" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="883022cdf654b26c79f78490e774c9c9" id="883022cdf654b26c79f78490e774c9c9"><span data-lake-id="u1136b3fd" id="u1136b3fd" class="lake-fontsize-12">下面是一个完整的实例：</span></p><p data-lake-id="e750fae3733c293fc854d53caff2a66e" id="e750fae3733c293fc854d53caff2a66e"><span data-lake-id="uaad580fe" id="uaad580fe" class="lake-fontsize-12">假设有三个源文件分别是：用户管理文件、产品管理文件和订单管理文件。函数命名为 addUser、addProduct 和 createOrder：</span></p><p data-lake-id="2ab8337e54c45d1b4f9b277b6194a20a" id="2ab8337e54c45d1b4f9b277b6194a20a" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560174273-a6b1e71c-e420-4107-a0b3-9f0673d702c0.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A257%2C%22height%22%3A190%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A324%2C%22originHeight%22%3A239%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f5f4f2%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22elUUx%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="8a56569b0993540c16de5a41e33e69c7" id="8a56569b0993540c16de5a41e33e69c7"><span data-lake-id="u746a4ddc" id="u746a4ddc" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="f2978e47a12814cdd2df2c1614e04259" id="f2978e47a12814cdd2df2c1614e04259"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560174512-21be9ad5-d4ff-4548-b1d7-664a073b5fbd.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A668%2C%22height%22%3A471%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A2120%2C%22originHeight%22%3A1496%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23313130%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cBMIY%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="43a6f9db441995ee47326c39139c78b0" id="43a6f9db441995ee47326c39139c78b0"><span data-lake-id="u7376da40" id="u7376da40" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="e737554f9f4a8ef156ba9c0aba233b87" id="e737554f9f4a8ef156ba9c0aba233b87"><span data-lake-id="u425ae944" id="u425ae944" class="lake-fontsize-12">详细文件见CODE文件夹</span></p><p data-lake-id="6a6617ab28a2713683ea7f55924fb992" id="6a6617ab28a2713683ea7f55924fb992"><span data-lake-id="uc3845124" id="uc3845124" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p>